{
  "id": "1101",
  "title": "Double Bed",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-11-14",
  "synopsis": "A dialogue about character composition between a teacher and a student.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1101/93c7af6e204bb982da4e6c73245a14dab2a37ccb.mp3?1596885281",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "双人床\n\n老师：“广”字下面加一个“木”字是什么字？\n学生：是“床”字，老师。\n老师：那“广”字下面加两个“木”字是什么字呢？\n学生：是双人床！",
    "traditional": "雙人床\n\n老師：“廣”字下面加一個“木”字是什麼字？\n學生：是“床”字，老師。\n老師：那“廣”字下面加兩個“木”字是什麼字呢？\n學生：是雙人床！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Double Bed"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "老师：“广”字下面加一个“木”字是什么字？",
      "traditional": "老師：“廣”字下面加一個“木”字是什麼字？",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī guǎng zì xià miàn jiā yí ge mù zì shì shén me zì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher: If you take the character for “wide” and add the character for “wood” under it, what character is that?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "学生：是“床”字，老师。",
      "traditional": "學生：是“床”字，老師。",
      "pinyin": "xué sheng shì chuáng zì lǎo shī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Student: It’s the character for “bed”, teacher."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "老师：那“广”字下面加两个“木”字是什么字呢？",
      "traditional": "老師：那“廣”字下面加兩個“木”字是什麼字呢？",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī nà guǎng zì xià miàn jiā liǎng ge mù zì shì shén me zì ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher: In that case, if you add two characters for “wood” under the character for “wide”, what character is that?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "学生：是双人床！",
      "traditional": "學生：是雙人床！",
      "pinyin": "xué sheng shì shuāng rén chuáng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Student: It’s a double bed!"
    }
  ],
